#ASSERT `Which limitation period applies to my claim` `PI` `SELF` `NOABUSE` (`the date` 5 12 2002) (`the date` 1 1 1970) (`the date` 5 12 2002) `ANY` FALSE TRUE FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `P18A`
#ASSERT `Which limitation period applies to my claim` `PI` `SELF` `sexual abuse` (`the date` 1 3 1980) (`the date` 1 1 1970) `ANY` `ANY` FALSE TRUE FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `PNONE`
#ASSERT `Which limitation period applies to my claim` `PI` `SELF` `sexual abuse` (`the date` 1 3 1990) (`the date` 1 3 1960) `ANY` `ANY` FALSE TRUE FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `P18A`
