-- The last day, no disability or fraud. s 50C(1)(a) counts the discoverable day itself (fork F2); the others run
-- from the day, which is not counted (fork F1).
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` `SELF` `NOABUSE` (`the date` 10 3 2015) (`the date` 1 1 1970) `ANY` (`the date` 10 3 2015) FALSE TRUE FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `LASTON` 9 3 2018
