-- s 52 (outside Division 6). A child of 10: 10.6.1995 to the 18th birthday 10.6.2003 is 2922 days; 10.6.1998 plus
-- 2922 days is 10.6.2006; s 52(1)(e) gives 3 years after 10.6.2003, also 10.6.2006.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` `SELF` `NOABUSE` (`the date` 10 6 1995) (`the date` 10 6 1985) (`the date` 10 6 1995) `ANY` FALSE TRUE FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `LASTON` 10 6 2006
-- An adult incapable from 1.7.2014 to 1.7.2015 (365 days): 1.1.2016 plus 365 days is 31.12.2016; s 52(1)(e): 3
-- years after 1.7.2015 is 1.7.2018, the later.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `CONTRACT` `SELF` `NOABUSE` `ANY` (`the date` 1 1 1970) (`the date` 1 1 2010) `ANY` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`the date` 1 7 2014) TRUE (`the date` 1 7 2015) FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `LASTON` 1 7 2018
