#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `CONTRACT` `SELF` `NOABUSE` `ANY` (`the date` 1 1 1970) (`the date` 1 1 2010) `ANY` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2016) TRUE (`the date` 1 2 2016) FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `LASTON` 1 2 2019
-- A continuing incapacity: stopped, but s 51 bars the action 30 years after 1.1.2010.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `CONTRACT` `SELF` `NOABUSE` `ANY` (`the date` 1 1 1970) (`the date` 1 1 2010) `ANY` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`the date` 1 7 2014) FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `STOPPEDTO` 1 1 2040
-- s 51: a deed, accrued 1.1.2001 to a child born 1.1.2000, then incapable 1.1.2018 to 1.1.2030. 1.1.2013 plus 6209
-- days of minority is 1.1.2030, plus 4383 days of incapacity is 1.1.2042; s 51 stops it at 1.1.2031.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `DEED` `SELF` `NOABUSE` `ANY` (`the date` 1 1 2000) (`the date` 1 1 2001) `ANY` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2018) TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2030) FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `LASTON` 1 1 2031

-- s 50F (Division 6). Incapable 1.1.2016 to 1.1.2017 (366 days): the 3 years end 28.2.2018 plus 366 = 1.3.2019; the
-- long-stop 1.3.2027 plus 366 = 1.3.2028. No s 52(1)(e) in Division 6 (s 50F(5)). A protected person is not suspended.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` `SELF` `NOABUSE` (`the date` 1 3 2015) (`the date` 1 1 1970) `ANY` (`the date` 1 3 2015) FALSE TRUE TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2016) TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2017) FALSE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `LASTON` 1 3 2019
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` `SELF` `NOABUSE` (`the date` 1 3 2015) (`the date` 1 1 1970) `ANY` (`the date` 1 3 2015) FALSE TRUE TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2016) TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2017) TRUE `ANY` FALSE `ANY` `ANY` FALSE `ANY` EQUALS `LASTON` 28 2 2018
-- A child of 10 with no capable parent: 1.7.2015 to the 18th birthday 1.7.2023 is 2922 days; 30.6.2018 plus 2922 is
-- 30.6.2026 (the long-stop 1.7.2027 plus 2922 is 1.7.2035). With a capable parent there is no suspension.
